{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_1000_052kao", "source_sha256": "a755189eaad6d5faf44bfb6eccc5dca416dfeb047f40f29e8b33827dc45caf6e", "ja": "ら～ららら～♪　ふふっ♪", "zh": "啦～啦啦啦～♪　呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8c442552ca2a9305ae10e9a8ae1e7d32a4334011eaa5dac762d6e2d2f4432f1d", "ja": "お疲れ様です、歌織さん。\n衣装はどうですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，歌织。\n服装感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "a864baed8580fc4fdf89ec05bc8e50c4b4f27b2435f682878da6b6525a56ae24", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！？\nもしかして今の……聞いてました？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！？\n难道刚才的……你都听到了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a1a331ba7528a6a9129135d53a902cf4d41b0d049d72094fa633915fc5f24030", "ja": "今のって……歌ってたことですか？　ええ。", "zh": "你说的是刚才……唱歌的事吗？　嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "67cb5b18eb238e9c7159185be1da91d17d13d2d1715eaaf63e5921fae91af51a", "ja": "も、もう！　やっぱり聞いてたんですね！\n……ううっ、恥ずかしい。", "zh": "真、真是的！果然还是被你听到了！\n……呜，好丢人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "418d7bd69280f8a8443765719e65d993283bbb6232e03b7b0a3b94b33276e0c5", "ja": "その、とっても素敵な衣装だったので嬉しくて。\nつい気持ちが高まってしまったんです……。", "zh": "因为那套服装实在太漂亮了，我一高兴，就不小心有些激动了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0ea926bae2f2318930a16ea84242495634c8ae7a91044e24d93a6230f91b429d", "ja": "そうでしたか。\n気に入ってくれたみたいで安心しました！", "zh": "这样啊。\n你喜欢这套服装，我就放心了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "e4f676ac9ee7b60de16d75dcae86fb0fc698c0e924a37cada1117ed22c227f91", "ja": "ええ、それはもちろん……あ、さっき美咲ちゃんから、\n衣装のコンセプトを教えてもらったんですよ。", "zh": "是的，那当然……啊，刚才美咲告诉了我这套服装的设计理念。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "2bf5e9791b5673d6b2a4840c3343c8d67e4bf5f87b27409bcc2b48512a8db107", "ja": "『音楽を届ける旅人』なんですよね？　私のステージを\n見た{$P$}さんのアイディアだって。", "zh": "是“传递音乐的旅人”，对吧？这是看过我的舞台的{$P$}先生所想到的点子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6d6d4a60461570bb5e0ca3f2207881643c0d7f512a38d91fcdddb76ea43a2f0e", "ja": "はい。歌織さんや、歌織さんの音楽が、\n世界へと羽ばたくように……そんな思いを込めました。", "zh": "是的。希望歌织小姐和歌织小姐的音乐，能够展翅飞向全世界……我就是怀着这样的心情构思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "7238cfd8aa949834f8521855f14d7260d7bfe5442bd7b9b21409309bdfe690d4", "ja": "まあ、ありがとうございます……あの、でも。\n世界に羽ばたくのは、私と音楽だけですか？", "zh": "哎呀，谢谢您……那个，但是。\n展翅飞向世界的，只有我和音乐吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_1011_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "109609925e4f2cdbecdd9c48c48b4c257239cf47bc8dadb39b948f606488de23", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、\n一緒に旅をしてくださると思っていたのに……。", "zh": "我还以为{$P$}先生也会陪我一起旅行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "a4b4ac97f5b2bfd0f5dffeef0cb55846c315631dcc9436dea458ff79852a7b4c", "ja": "私を、ひとりにするんですか？　……なんて。", "zh": "您要把我一个人留下吗？……开玩笑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_1014_p", "source_sha256": "aafd08c978381d14035bea6af71a59a0134a8abfcb954959a738e4a4e0463a42", "ja": "歌織さん……いえ、すみません。\n発言を訂正します。これからも……。", "zh": "歌织小姐……不，抱歉。我更正一下刚才的话。今后也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_1015", "source_sha256": "6e196836080d8b63c9b9f7854cd75d134a6369450104d33d7fe43746816b8b51", "ja": "ずっと一緒に", "zh": "永远在一起", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_2000_p", "source_sha256": "2db211e2a3cdbdba1b836cb15799f7aaab2821ff63b1414a936be76d09f8fa38", "ja": "歌織さんと歌織さんの音楽と一緒に、\nずっと旅を続けます！　プロデューサー人生をかけて！", "zh": "我会和歌织，以及歌织的音乐一起，永远继续这段旅程！赌上我的制作人生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_2001_052kao", "source_sha256": "2dfbdac5ae3d901e16788cd82bf8f05e3eeecaec03275e29ad8cf07801b231c2", "ja": "まあ……ふふっ♪　そんなに大きな声で言われると、\n少し照れてしまいますけど。でも……嬉しい。", "zh": "哎呀……呵呵♪　被你这么大声地说出来，我都有点害羞了。不过……我很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_2002_052kao", "source_sha256": "9715fb149a42d8efd387aaf2d00418622abcf188590cbd044449acf037a4802d", "ja": "それと……ごめんなさい。その言葉が聞きたくて、\nちょっとイジワルしちゃいました。ふふっ♪", "zh": "还有……对不起。因为想听到那句话，\n所以稍微捉弄了您一下。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_2003_052kao", "source_sha256": "85bf557469502e32a7cd718461f0ac630f806c22a6deedbffac7601543b35d2b", "ja": "私の音楽には、{$P$}さんは\n欠かせません。これからも、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "我的音乐中，{$P$}先生是不可或缺的。今后也请多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_2004_p", "source_sha256": "f5c756fc68b7192a3c5ac9d11e3ca7e7f1ea4007ca9b7998ae668fbc139ed30a", "ja": "ええ、こちらこそ！", "zh": "嗯，我也要请您多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0234_2005_052kao", "source_sha256": "0c7fdd36c58046b46c8787c90ac23c1206b939a49e41aee60fb12ff33eade763", "ja": "私たちの音楽を、届けるために……。\nもっと広い世界へと。ずっと旅をしましょうね♪", "zh": "为了将我们的音乐传递出去……\n向着更广阔的世界。让我们一直旅行下去吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
